        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Local, filtered copy of the W3C PROV Ontology (PROV-O) imported by the Tracking CJF ontology. It keeps the PROV-O terms and axioms the CJF ontology depends on and leaves out the parts of PROV-O that the CJF ontology does not use.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">W3C PROVenance Interchange Ontology (PROV-O)</rdfs:label>
